<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>404 · Página no encontrada · <%= siteTitle || 'MyCMS' %></title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=DM+Serif+Display&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root { --accent: #6366f1; --text: #111827; --muted: #6b7280; --border: #e5e7eb; }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
      color: var(--text); margin: 0; background: #fff;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    }
    .site-header {
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 14px 24px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .site-name { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); text-decoration: none; }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 4px; }
    .nav-links a { color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 500; padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 6px; }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--text); background: #f9fafb; }

    .error-body {
      flex: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      padding: 60px 24px; text-align: center;
    }
    .error-inner { max-width: 480px; }
    .error-code {
      font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
      font-size: 7rem; line-height: 1; color: #e5e7eb;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em; margin-bottom: 4px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #8b5cf6);
      -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }
    .error-title { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .error-desc { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.65; margin-bottom: 32px; }
    .error-actions { display: flex; gap: 10px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .btn-home {
      background: var(--accent); color: white; text-decoration: none;
      padding: 10px 22px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem;
      transition: background 0.15s;
    }
    .btn-home:hover { background: #4f46e5; color: white; }
    .btn-back {
      background: #f3f4f6; color: var(--text); text-decoration: none;
      padding: 10px 22px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem;
      transition: background 0.15s;
    }
    .btn-back:hover { background: #e5e7eb; }

    /* Quick links */
    .quick-links { margin-top: 40px; padding-top: 28px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .quick-links-title { font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.07em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .quick-links-list { display: flex; gap: 8px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .quick-link {
      padding: 6px 14px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 20px;
      text-decoration: none; color: var(--text); font-size: 0.85rem; transition: all 0.15s;
    }
    .quick-link:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }

    .site-footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 18px 24px; text-align: center; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.8rem; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="site-header">
  <a href="/" class="site-name"><%= siteTitle || 'MyCMS' %></a>
  <nav class="nav-links">
    <a href="/">Inicio</a>
    <% if (navPages && navPages.length > 0) { %>
      <% navPages.forEach(p => { %><a href="/page/<%= p.slug %>"><%= p.title %></a><% }) %>
    <% } %>
  </nav>
</header>

<div class="error-body">
  <div class="error-inner">
    <div class="error-code">404</div>
    <h1 class="error-title">Página no encontrada</h1>
    <p class="error-desc">
      Lo sentimos, la página que buscas no existe, ha sido movida o su dirección ha cambiado.
    </p>
    <div class="error-actions">
      <a href="/" class="btn-home"><i class="bi bi-house me-1"></i>Volver al inicio</a>
      <a href="javascript:history.back()" class="btn-back"><i class="bi bi-arrow-left me-1"></i>Página anterior</a>
    </div>

    <% if (navPages && navPages.length > 0) { %>
    <div class="quick-links">
      <div class="quick-links-title">Páginas disponibles</div>
      <div class="quick-links-list">
        <% navPages.forEach(p => { %>
          <a href="/page/<%= p.slug %>" class="quick-link"><%= p.title %></a>
        <% }) %>
      </div>
    </div>
    <% } %>
  </div>
</div>

<footer class="site-footer">
  <a href="/" style="color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;"><%= siteTitle || 'MyCMS' %></a>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
